  "slug": "drifters",
  "title": "Drifters",
  "description": "Drifters by Studio Drift and Sil van der Woerd is about an entity in search of its origin and purpose. Colossal floating blocks of concrete, as living monoliths, migrate through an untouched landscape, without context, without reference, lost in space and time, on the move to something bigger to fall in place. ‍Drifters has been screened in some of the most prestigious venues across the globe, from Times Square to The Shed and Amos Rex.",
