            "role": "Director",
            "name": "Sil van der Woerd"
          },
          {
            "role": "Co-Directors",
            "name": "Lonneke Gordijn and Ralph Nauta"
          },
          {
            "role": "Cinematographer",
            "name": "Keidrych Wasley"
          }
        ],
        "fullCredits": "### Drifters (2017)\n\n‍\n\n### A Film by\n\nStudio Drift and Sil van der Woerd\n\n### Directed by\n\nSil van der Woerd\n\n### Co-Directed by\n\nLonneke Gordijn\n\nRalph Nauta\n\n### Produced by\n\nSil van der Woerd\n\nLonneke Gordijn\n\nRalph Nauta\n\n### Director of Photography\n\nKeidrych Wasley\n\n### Edit\n\nSil van der Woerd\n\n### VFX Supervisor\n\nSil van der Woerd\n\nEvaldas Cesnavicius\n\nLuuk Meijer\n\n### Music and Sound Design\n\nVitaliy Zavadskyy\n\n### Location Scout\n\nSil van der Woerd\n\nKeidrych Wasley\n\n### Music Mix\n\nPost City Sound Inc\n\nLook Development Evaldas Cesnavicius\n\n### 3D and Compositing\n\nEvaldas Cesnavicius\n\nSil van der Woerd\n\nKestutis Rinkevicius\n\nAlvydas Jatkialo\n\nRaphael El Khaddar\n\nJenny van Son\n\nPim Reinders\n\nRoy Hoes\n\nMaria Peralta Ramos\n\n### Digimatte\n\nJorik Dozy\n\n### Color Grading\n\nBart Verraest\n\n### Thanks to\n\nStorm Post Production\n\nJack Kuiper\n\n‍\n\n### Drifters New York (2021)\n\n‍\n\n### A Film by\n\nStudio Drift and Sil van der Woerd\n\n### Production\n\nStudio Drift and Sil van der Woerd\n\n### Visual Effects & Post Production\n\nMethod & Madness\n\n### Visual Effects Supervisor\n\nWen Hao Tan\n\n### Visual Effects Artists\n\nAlex Scollay\n\nPinoy Reyes\n\nHuzaifi Razali\n\nHisman Taufik\n\nAbdul Rahman\n\nHuiying Gob\n\nEugene Seah\n\nValmik Chavan\n\n### Score\n\nVitaliy Zavadskyy\n\n### All Rights Reserved\n\nStudio Drift 2021\n\n‍",
