      "type": "text",
      "content": {
        "heading": "The Shed",
        "body": "The Shed is one of New York's most unique venues and brings together established and emerging artists in an unprecedented movable structure that adapts to support all kinds of inventive work under one roof. Both the Drifter exhibition as well as the film were hosted in the venue."
      },
