    {
      "id": "text-13",
      "type": "text",
      "content": {
        "heading": "Human Systems",
        "body": "Drifters - a collaboration between Sil van der Woerd and Amsterdam based Studio Drift - is a companion work to the installation Drifter and displays how basic and rough human systems are, in contrast to the natural.\n\n‍\n\nThe work can be seen from the perspective of whether or not the individual can escape from the collective."
      },
      "padTop": "4-5",
      "padBottom": "4-5"
